---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-white/50 bg-white/40 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-ink-950/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-8xl px-4 py-10 lg:px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-sm">
        <a href={base + '/'} class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">
          <span class="inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-accent-500/30 bg-accent-500/10 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400">
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="5 8 9 12 5 16"/><line x1="11" y1="16" x2="17" y2="16"/></svg>
          </span>
          promptbox
        </a>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-500">
          <span data-lang="en">A copy-paste toolbox for AI coding agents.</span>
          <span data-lang="ko">AI 코딩 에이전트를 위한, 복사해서 바로 쓰는 도구 모음.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-2 text-sm" aria-label="Footer" data-aria-en="Footer" data-aria-ko="푸터">
        <a href={base + '/#catalog'} class="inline-block py-1.5 text-ink-600 transition-colors hover:text-accent-700 dark:text-ink-300 dark:hover:text-accent-400"><span data-lang="en">Catalog</span><span data-lang="ko">카탈로그</span></a>
        <a href={base + '/#how-it-works'} class="inline-block py-1.5 text-ink-600 transition-colors hover:text-accent-700 dark:text-ink-300 dark:hover:text-accent-400"><span data-lang="en">Guide</span><span data-lang="ko">사용법</span></a>
        <a href={base + '/tips/'} class="inline-block py-1.5 text-ink-600 transition-colors hover:text-accent-700 dark:text-ink-300 dark:hover:text-accent-400"><span data-lang="en">Tips (pi setup)</span><span data-lang="ko">Tips &amp; Tricks (pi)</span></a>
        <a href={base + '/tips/opencode/'} class="inline-block py-1.5 text-ink-600 transition-colors hover:text-accent-700 dark:text-ink-300 dark:hover:text-accent-400"><span data-lang="en">Tips — OpenCode 2</span><span data-lang="ko">Tips — OpenCode 2</span></a>
        <a href="https://github.com/cskwork/promptbox" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block py-1.5 text-ink-600 transition-colors hover:text-accent-700 dark:text-ink-300 dark:hover:text-accent-400"><span data-lang="en">Repository</span><span data-lang="ko">저장소</span></a>
        <a href="https://github.com/cskwork/promptbox#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-block py-1.5 text-ink-600 transition-colors hover:text-accent-700 dark:text-ink-300 dark:hover:text-accent-400"><span data-lang="en">Contribute</span><span data-lang="ko">항목 추가</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-1 border-t border-white/40 pt-5 text-xs text-ink-500 dark:border-white/5 dark:text-ink-400 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p><span data-lang="en">Built with Astro &amp; Tailwind. Site shell: MIT.</span><span data-lang="ko">Astro와 Tailwind로 제작. 사이트 셸은 MIT.</span></p>
      <p><span data-lang="en">Each item follows its source's license.</span><span data-lang="ko">각 항목의 라이선스는 원본 출처를 따릅니다.</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
